Whatever bundled wordlist: provenance and licensing.

WHAT IS BUNDLED
- eff-large.txt: the EFF large wordlist for random passphrases (7776 words,
  one per line as "<dice-number>\t<word>"), retrieved 2026-10-09 from
  https://www.eff.org/files/2016/07/18/eff_large_wordlist.txt
  and shipped byte-identical. It backs the password generator's words mode:
  each word carries ~12.9 bits, so 4 words hold ~52 bits and 6 hold ~77.

